sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Workbench
  participant B as Real browser
  participant G as Data proxy gate
  participant Z as ZooGlass
  W->>W: Declare expected-fault interval
  W->>G: Break client data path
  G->>G: Reject new upgrades and discard queued relay data
  G--xB: Abruptly terminate active transport
  G--xZ: Close upstream transport
  B->>B: Observe closure, label last data, start retry
  B-->>W: Report interruption over live control path
  B->>G: Automatic reconnect attempt
  G-->>B: Refused while gate is closed
  W->>Z: Source sends position 43
  W->>Z: Check both server views contain 43
  W->>G: Restore route
  Note over W,B: No reconnect command is sent to the app
  B->>G: Next automatic reconnect attempt
  G->>Z: Establish upstream connection
  B->>Z: Resubscribe through proxy
  Z-->>B: Acknowledgements and initial snapshots through 43
  B-->>W: Report receipts for new connection generation
  W->>W: Check first snapshots and independent rendered result
  Note over W,Z: Source and browser control remain live throughout
